	//
	// The people the parent company's admin access lets act here as Administrators, each badged with
	// the parent it comes through. "The daughter's Manage users shows every holding access
	// source-badged" (Corporate family), so no power over this company is hidden from it.
	//
	// WHO IS A ROW. While this company is the daughter of a linked parent whose admin access is on,
	// every person who holds Owner or Administrator across that parent now. Each person once, as an
	// Administrator, never as an Owner: Owner of a company is held only by its own people. One step
	// and no further: the parent's own parent reaches nobody here (decision 0823). A person
	// suspended in the parent is not a row (decision 0829).
	//
	// NEVER ONE OF THIS COMPANY'S MEMBERS. They are not on `listMembers`, they hold no assignment
