	// address, as an invoice, a mail a flow sends or the trust page show them. There is no separate "sender
	// profile": this is the first one, and most companies never add another.
	//
	// NOT GATED inside the company: every member sees the company they are in, and the request is
	// already scoped to it. Who OUTSIDE the company sees which detail is Company Profile → Profile
	// Visibility, which is not declared yet. Answered in a Business Environment only; a personal
	// environment has no company, and answers 404.
