	// CheckCompanyDomain Check a domain's proof now
	//
	// Asks Onplo to look for the record soon instead of at its next scheduled look. THE LOOK IS
	// QUEUED, NEVER MADE INSIDE THIS CALL (decision 0755): the answer is the domain as it stands,
	// with `check_requested_at` saying a look is waiting, and what the look found is read from the
	// list afterwards. A record just published can take a while to be visible, so Pending after a
	// look is ordinary and not a failure. Asking again while a look is still waiting changes
	// nothing and answers the same.
	//
	// ONPLO DOES NOT LOOK YET. Until the process that looks is running, a queued look waits and
	// the claim stays Pending.
