	// CastFeatureVote Vote for a future feature
	//
	// Your one vote on a feature an app has decided to build later, cast from your personal
	// environment. "ONE PERSON, ONE VOTE — the vote belongs to the account, never to the
	// environment": somebody who belongs to twenty companies still has one vote on a feature. An
	// agent may draft a vote for you to cast, and never casts it itself.
