	// VOTING AGAIN IS THE SAME VOTE. A second vote on the same feature changes nothing and answers
	// the vote as it was first cast, so a retry whose answer was lost is never told it already
	// voted. There is no second vote to refuse, and so no 409.
	//
	// THE FEATURE IS NAMED BY ITS PERMANENT ID, `<app>.feature.<concept>`, as its app's roadmap
	// lists it. An id no app's roadmap lists is refused with a 422 naming `future_feature_id`, and
	// no vote is kept.
