	// CompletePaymentMethodReplacement Make the new card or bank account the one this environment pays with
	//
	// CALLED WHEN THE PERSON COMES BACK from the provider's page, exactly as a setup's completion
	// is. If they finished, the new payment method replaces the old one from this moment, and the
	// answer is it. If they left without finishing, or the page expired, the old one stays in use and
	// this is refused with `setup_not_finished`.
	//
	// ASKING TWICE IS SAFE, and a replacement that is not this environment's, or was never started,
	// answers `not_found`.
	//
	// Corresponds with POST /payment-method/replacements/{payment_method_setup_id}/completion (the `CompletePaymentMethodReplacement` operationId).
