	// person finishes is the one that counts.
	//
	// ONLY WHILE THERE IS NONE. Once a payment method is set this is refused with
	// `payment_method_already_set`; replacing it is
	// `POST /payment-method/replacements`, which asks its own permission.
	//
	// Takes a body of the `application/json` content type.
