	// CompletePaymentMethodSetup Make what the person entered this environment's payment method
	//
	// CALLED WHEN THE PERSON COMES BACK from the provider's page. The provider is asked how the
	// setup ended: if they finished, what they entered is the environment's payment method from this
	// moment, and the answer is it. If they left without finishing, or the page expired, nothing
	// changed and this is refused with `setup_not_finished`; start a new setup.
	//
	// ASKING TWICE IS SAFE. Completing a setup that is already complete answers the same payment
	// method and changes nothing, so a completion whose answer was lost is simply sent again.
	//
	// A SETUP THAT IS NOT THIS ENVIRONMENT'S, OR WAS NEVER STARTED, answers `not_found`, the same for
