	// Before anything is deleted, everything published goes dark, enrolled devices are released,
	// guests and linked companies lose their grants and are told, and every machine, agent, flow and
	// connection the company owned stops. Members keep themselves: closing ends every membership and
	// touches nobody's personal environment.
