	//
	// THE ONE PLACE THE PER-DETAIL CHOICE IS READ, answered in the environment this credential acts
	// in. In a company, a person who has never touched it reads the company's baseline rather than
	// an empty answer — the same reason `Profile.email` is present-and-null rather than absent.
	//
	// EACH DETAIL SAYS THE COMPANY'S CHOICE TOO, also after the member has hidden it. The switch and
	// the locked row both show "the company's choice and the reason on the row", and a screen with
	// two controls chooses between the two writes below by which control it drew. Until 2026-10-03
	// this answered each detail's current audience and nothing else, so once a member hid their
	// phone the company's choice was nowhere in the answer (measured, decision 0658).
	//
	// NOT GATED. Reading who can see your own card is not a thing a company withholds; it is how a
	// member finds out what was decided for them, and the locked state on the screen has to be able
	// to say what it is locked to.
	//
