	// ChooseProfileVisibilityWithBodyWithResponse Choose who can see each detail of your profile card, from all four
	//
	// THE FOUR-WAY PICKER. A member who may choose beyond the company's choice picks freely for each
	// detail: any of the four audiences, or `company_choice` to go back to following the company
	// (`VisibilityChoice`). Every detail is optional and an omitted one is untouched; it writes in the
