	// sign in", "which environments is this person in" and "revoke this person everywhere" in one
	// place, and "it never opens anything a person made", in the catalogue's words.
	//
	// WHOSE FACTS THESE ARE: the environments and the person's name are Account's. The sign-in methods
	// (kind, name, when added) and the live sessions (device, last seen) are the identity service's,
	// asked on every answer — never a key, never a token.
