// SeverFamilyLinkWithResponse Sever the link — from either side
//
// The relation ends now. The switches and the consolidated views stop; pushed policies stay in
// the daughter and become its own; if the parent paid the bills, a grace period starts for the
// daughter to add its own payment method; and the period's consolidated reports become evidence
// in both companies' Compliance. Data never moves, because nothing was ever blended. Severing an
// invite that was not accepted yet withdraws it, and the side that was invited may decline it
// the same way.
//
