// TWO WORDS AND NEVER A WIDER AUDIENCE, SO NOTHING IS COMPARED (decision 0658). Choosing beyond
// the company's choice is its own permission, so it is its own operation —
// `chooseProfileVisibility`, gated by `account:profile-visibility.publish` at its door. This one
// cannot be handed a wider value: a third word is the schema's ordinary 422. Until 2026-10-03 this
// operation took any audience and a handler was to refuse the wider ones as a 403, which was a
// permission test made on a value — exactly what decision 0658 rules out.
