// today and tomorrow; only `private` is a choice of the member's own that stands when the company
// later changes its mind (Jonas, 2026-10-03).
//
// IN A PERSONAL ENVIRONMENT there is no company, so `company_choice` is refused (422 naming the
// field). A person there uses `chooseProfileVisibility`, as the owner of their own environment.
